  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A bowl filled with very hot soup cools from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>98</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to $86^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ in 2 minutes when the room temperature is $22^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$. How long it will take to cool from $75^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ to $69^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ ?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;minute</p>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;minute",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;minute",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;minute",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From Newton&#39;s law of cooling, we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>avg</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>T</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is the mass, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi></math> is the specific heat and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;is the temperature change.</p><p>Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>minutes</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>98</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>86</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mn>70</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>69</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Dividing (2) by (1), we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>50</mn><mn>70</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math></p>"
  }
}